# The settings file every launch receives, and the state it puts on screen.
title The hooks and the status line
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
pre rm -rf .devcontainer
run demo-shell
wait 1
type clear
enter
wait 0.5
chapter Hooks and state
caption lmux sandbox show standard | the settings file a launch receives, byte for byte
type lmux sandbox show standard | head -26
enter
wait 2
frame 4
caption the workspace reads its own hooks | busy, waiting or idle, on the border and in the bar
type clear
enter
wait 0.4
type lmux create . --layout trio --nested
enter
wait 7
frame 4
caption the agent pane | the status line under the agent says the same thing
frame 4
